    # s happy2 "{cps=40}\"Esse tempo todo, ele estava embaixo da minha cama, e eu dando voltas e voltas no meu bairro, hahahahah....{/cps}\""
    s happy2 "{cps=40}\"That whole time, he was under my bed, while I was going around and around my neighborhood, hahahahah....{/cps}\""

# game/Arco1/capitulo1.3_escola.rpy:863
translate english encontrostella_d58b7246_1:

    # k divertindo "{cps=40}\"Hahahaha, você deve ter achado engraçado na hora né?\"{/cps}"
    k divertindo "{cps=40}\"Hahahaha, you must have found that funny at the time, right?\"{/cps}"

# game/Arco1/capitulo1.3_escola.rpy:864
translate english encontrostella_5cb410bd_1:

    # s happy2 "{cps=40}\"Na hora eu briguei com ele porque ele não me respondia, nem quando eu chamava com a ração hahahaha.{/cps}\""
    s happy2 "{cps=40}\"At the time I scolded him because he wouldn't answer me, not even when I called him with food, hahahaha.{/cps}\""

# game/Arco1/capitulo1.3_escola.rpy:867
translate english encontrostella_2922be43:

    # s feliz3 "{cps=40}\"Mas depois eu achei engraçado, porque ele estava lá, e eu nem tinha percebido...\"{/cps}"
    s feliz3 "{cps=40}\"But afterward I thought it was funny, because he was right there and I hadn't even noticed...\"{/cps}"

# game/Arco1/capitulo1.3_escola.rpy:870
translate english encontrostella_c408f40f_1:

    # s feliz "{cps=40}\"Aiai, nossa, nem vi o tempo passar, obrigada por me mostrar a Faculdade Kioku, eu adorei conhecer tudo isso...\"{/cps}"
    s feliz "{cps=40}\"Aiai, wow, I didn't even see the time pass. Thank you for showing me around the college, Kioku. I loved getting to know all of this...\"{/cps}"

# game/Arco1/capitulo1.3_escola.rpy:871
translate english encontrostella_f42e383c_1:

